<%# locals: (dom_id:, progress:, label: "CI", test_id: "ci-progress-bar", compact: false, wrapper_class: nil, inner_test_id: nil, href: nil) %>
<%#
  Stable-id wrapper around the CI meter so a LIVE CI update (CiCheckJob
  after_commit, via DeploymentsBroadcaster) can morph-replace THIS slot alone — the
  meter re-renders, the surrounding card never flashes.

  Picks the meter shape by check count: components/_ci_progress_symbols when a suite
  has FEW checks (progress.symbolic?, one glyph per check), else the numeric
  components/_ci_progress_bar. Both share these locals, so a re-run that changes the
  count re-renders whichever now fits.

  When `href` is present (a task's devops.pr_url), the whole meter becomes a link
  that opens the PR in a NEW TAB (target=_blank rel=noopener); @click.stop keeps the
  card's own click-to-open-task handler from firing. Absent href (the release G3
  slot has no single PR) -> a plain div, no link.

  The outer div ALWAYS renders (even when blank) so the Turbo replace target exists
  before the run's first check settles; empty, it is a zero-height block.
%>
<div id="<%= dom_id %>" data-test="<%= dom_id %>-slot">
  <% if progress.respond_to?(:present?) && progress.present? %>
    <% meter = capture do %>
      <% if progress.symbolic? %>
        <%= render "components/ci_progress_symbols",
              progress: progress, label: (label || "CI"), test_id: test_id, compact: compact %>
      <% else %>
        <%= render "components/ci_progress_bar",
              progress: progress, label: (label || "CI"), test_id: test_id, compact: compact %>
      <% end %>
    <% end %>
    <% if href.present? %>
      <a href="<%= href %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" @click.stop
         class="ci-progress-link block hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity <%= wrapper_class %>"
         <% if inner_test_id %>data-test="<%= inner_test_id %>"<% end %>
         title="Open the pull request on GitHub"><%= meter %></a>
    <% else %>
      <div class="<%= wrapper_class %>"<% if inner_test_id %> data-test="<%= inner_test_id %>"<% end %>><%= meter %></div>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>
